eam up with friends to tackle challenging dungeons together or compete against other players in thrilling PvP battles.\n\n7. Events and Updates: The game frequently introduces new events and updates, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting. These events may introduce limited-time rewards, new dungeons, or special challenges to test your skills.\n\nOverall, Roblox Anime Dungeon Fighters provides an engaging experience for anime and dungeon crawling enthusiasts alike. So gear up, gather your friends, and embark on an epic adventure in this visually stunning and action-packed world!","tags":["Anime Dungeons Fighters","Roblox","Script"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://freenote.biz/raw/9ANHze2wee\"))();","owner":{"_id":"64ec6bdaf03b291094c74c85","username":"Christopher_YT","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/64ec6bdaf03b291094c74c85-1708867831641.jpg","status":"offline","id":"64ec6bdaf03b291094c74c85"},"verified":false,"keyLink":"https://workink.xyz/1Sx0/Get-Key-Anime-Dungeon-fighters-New","views":64266,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-02-14T11:21:29.620Z","dislikeCount":2,"likeCount":1,"image":"/images/sb/12135640403-1707909689599.webp","executes":511,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e5b360710ec3c5036c","editBy":{"_id":"64ec6bdaf03b291094c74c85","username":"Christopher_YT","status":"offline","id":"64ec6bdaf03b291094c74c85"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:58:23.146Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"65ce5368e3f71dd8fbf35657","commentBy":{"_id":"6583fcbb5724e2e8a9fc6e1b","username":"Just_Want_Candy","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","createdAt":"2023-12-21T08:52:11.220Z","lastActive":"2026-02-20T14:59:54.502Z","status":"offline","id":"6583fcbb5724e2e8a9fc6e1b"},"text":"3 trojan to get key take care\n-","createdAt":"2024-02-15T18:09:44.382Z","edited":true,"li